> 	By the way, what adventure series did Stormbringer come from?  
> I've forgotten the title...I vaguely recall it appears in book six
> of the E____ series?

The Elric series, by Michael Moorcock.  It was present throughout the
series,
along with its "twin", Mourneblade.  Stormbringer was actually a nasty
demon
whose material form was that of a sword.  Stormbringer could even drain the
life from demon princes (Lord Pyaray among them), something which should be
fixed in NH3.1.  I also recall that Stormbringer could be satiated, which
happened once while Elric was fighting an army of summoned warriors. Though
I doubt this is what happended.

Stormbringer had some other powers: gave energy to its wielder, danced on
command, would teleport or fly to Elric (once across dimensions), a nasty
tendency to drain the life from Elric's companions, and once it summoned
several hundred of its brothers (quite a sight...2-3 hundred stormbringers
coming at ya).

Arioch, by the way, was the Prince of Swords (a Chaos Lord) in the same 
series, and Elric's patron.  Arioch, however, did not give the sword to
Elric.

